      "notes": "Control Change list read by tools/profiles/roland/read-cc-list.mjs from P-6_eng01_W.pdf, page 147 (sha256 37301777dcca8bf73f611bb6e166982ea9803e8aef9b07d3d590ff67e4c47475), https://static.roland.com/assets/media/pdf/P-6_eng01_W.pdf. Not yet checked against the instrument itself."
